  "description": "FLAT openEHR JSON serializer for DotnetOpenEhr. Round-trips the\n      openEHR FLAT JSON dialect (slash-delimited path keys, scalar\n      values) into the DotnetOpenEhr.Rm strongly-typed Reference Model.\n      Schemaless mode resolves polymorphism via monomorphic-RM lookup\n      plus inline _type discriminators; schema-driven mode delegates to\n      DotnetOpenEhr.Templates.Abstractions.ITemplateSchema. Trim-safe\n      and Native-AOT-safe. Single TFM net10.0.",
